            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Kip Thorne</strong><br>\nKip Thorne was born on June 1, 1940, in Logan, Utah. As the son of two professors, he was introduced to academia at an early age. Growing up, Thorne showed an early interest in science and mathematics. He attended public schools before enrolling at the California Institute of Technology (Caltech) for his undergraduate studies. His fascination with physics began to shape his future career path during these formative years.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Career Beginnings</strong><br>\nAfter completing his undergraduate degree at Caltech, Thorne went on to pursue his Ph.D. at Princeton University. He was mentored by John Wheeler, a prominent figure in theoretical physics. Wheeler's influence on Thorne was profound, inspiring him to delve deep into the realm of general relativity. After receiving his Ph.D., Thorne returned to Caltech as a professor, where he spent much of his academic career.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Research on Gravitational Waves</strong><br>\nThorne's most notable work is on gravitational waves, ripples in the fabric of space-time predicted by Albert Einstein's general theory of relativity. He worked on developing theoretical tools to better understand these waves. His research contributed significantly to the eventual observation of gravitational waves by the LIGO project in 2015, a landmark discovery that opened a new window into the cosmos.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
